2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Semiconductor Integrated Circuits Layout-Design Act, 2000 (
37 of 2000
);
(b)
"Form" means a form set out in the Schedule II;
(c)
"journal" means the Semiconductor Integrated Circuits Layout-Design Journal published by the Registrar of
Semiconductor Integrated Circuits Layout-Designs;
(d)
"layout-design no." means the Registration number of the layout-design registered under the Act;
(e)
"Registry" means the Semiconductor Integrated Circuits Layout-Design Registry;
(f)
"Schedule" means a Schedule to these rules;
(g)
"Section" means a section of the Act.
